	"FriendlyName": "Easy language",
	"Description": "Easy language: a safe, zero-modification editor localization plugin for UE 5.7/5.8. Switch the whole editor UI (engine + any plugins) between English / Chinese / any language on the fly without restarting. Patch untranslated third-party plugins with a visual text picker and your own dictionaries. Nothing in the engine or your assets is ever modified; it is excluded from packaging automatically (Editor-only).",
